        expires: '2026-12-05'
    - 'eslint > minimatch':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-11-05 on eslint@9.39.5 > minimatch@3.1.5: minimatch@3.1.5. Amplification requires attacker-controlled patterns with optimizationLevel >= 2; installed minimatch v3/v5 has neither firstPhasePreProcess nor optimizationLevel. These callers use repository-controlled lint, build, package-script or help-file patterns. Fixed v11.0.3 cleared seven-day cooldown on 2026-11-04T20:00:34.713Z, but its object exports replace the callable API used by legacy callers. Modern v7+ paths are overridden to v11.0.3. Remove when upstream adopts a compatible fixed release; reassess if callers or pattern sources change.'
