    - 'testcontainers > archiver > readdir-glob > minimatch':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-11-05 on testcontainers@12.2.1 > archiver@7.0.1 > readdir-glob@1.1.3 > minimatch@5.1.9: minimatch@5.1.9. Amplification requires attacker-controlled patterns with optimizationLevel >= 2; installed minimatch v3/v5 has neither firstPhasePreProcess nor optimizationLevel. These callers use repository-controlled lint, build, package-script or help-file patterns. Fixed v11.0.3 cleared seven-day cooldown on 2026-11-04T20:00:34.713Z, but its v11 preprocessing semantics are outside readdir-globs supported v5 range. This path is installed in production; readdir-glob only passes dot, noglobstar, matchBase and nocase, never optimizationLevel >= 2. Modern v7+ paths are overridden to v11.0.3. Remove when upstream adopts a compatible fixed release; reassess if callers or pattern sources change.'
